isVertexDecomposable -- determines whether a simplicial complex is vertex-decomposable
**************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        isVertexDecomposable S
  * Inputs:
      * S, an *note abstract simplicial complex:
        (SimplicialComplexes)SimplicialComplex,,
  * Outputs:
      * B, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, true if and only if
        $S$ is vertex-decomposable

Description
===========

Vertex-decomposability is just zero-decomposability when $S$ is pure, see [PB].
When $S$ is non-pure, [BW-2] gives a generalisation: A complex $S$ is vertex
decomposable if it is either a simplex or there exists a shedding vertex.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..f];                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : isVertexDecomposable simplicialComplex {a*b*c*d*e}                |
|                                                                       |
|o2 = true                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isVertexDecomposable skeleton(3, simplicialComplex {a*b*c*d*e})   |
|                                                                       |
|o3 = true                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isVertexDecomposable simplicialComplex {a*b*c, c*d*e}             |
|                                                                       |
|o4 = false                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isVertexDecomposable simplicialComplex {a*b*c, c*d, d*e, e*f, d*f}|
|                                                                       |
|o5 = true                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+

Whether the complex is vertex-decomposable is cached.

